{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battles on the Field</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clash with rival lords and ruthless bandits on the battlefield! Prove your dominance not only with your sword but with your wit. Weaken your enemies through combat, disrupt their economies, or force them into trade to assert your supremacy. Every decision shapes your power and reputation across the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/6a07cbfcdd48c27aa86a2f8595c050ad.poster.avif?t=1760107590\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/6a07cbfcdd48c27aa86a2f8595c050ad.webm?t=1760107590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your City Freely</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your lands and shape your city the way you imagine. Gather resources like stone, wood, and iron, establish production sites, and strengthen your economy. Outbuild your rivals, gain the upper hand, and transform your city into a thriving trade hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/acb8887b0c227af36106b563f8cafeb6.poster.avif?t=1760107590\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/acb8887b0c227af36106b563f8cafeb6.webm?t=1760107590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Governance and People\u2019s Happiness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building a city is not just about raising structures it\u2019s about caring for your people. Provide food, housing, health, and security, while fulfilling royal demands to maintain order. A happy and healthy population is the true foundation of prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/05af31b733011fb1992b28fca606b1b8.poster.avif?t=1760107590\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/05af31b733011fb1992b28fca606b1b8.webm?t=1760107590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Order and Economy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your threats aren\u2019t only from outside danger lurks within as well. Keep thieves in check, prevent quarrels among soldiers, and protect your people from hunger. Balance food, shelter, and economy to maintain order and earn the trust of your citizens.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/56dffe2ea7ac6f955579537caef3582c.poster.avif?t=1760107590\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/56dffe2ea7ac6f955579537caef3582c.webm?t=1760107590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948100?t=1760107590","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948100?t=1760107590","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/7d42dcbc7b17c241c8c2daf1536ee346dbfa2d0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760107590","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/7d42dcbc7b17c241c8c2daf1536ee34